[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    180[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |----------|------|--------------------------|
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    181[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `c2Dot` | `a.x*b.x + a.y*b.y` | `mulss` #2 dest = `b.y`; `addss` dest = the *second* product |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    182[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `c2Add` | `a.x += b.x` | `addss` dest = `b.x` (the **right** operand) |
