[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    184[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `c2Mulvs` | `a.x *= b` | `mulss` dest = `a.x` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    185[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `c2Div` | `1.0f / b` | `divss` dest = the `1.0f` constant |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    186[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `c2MulmvT` | both components | `mulss` #2 dest = `b.y`; `addss` dest = second product |
